# EV Charging Station Management & Software Metrics System
## Architecture & Implementation Roadmap

### 1. Executive Overview
This document specifies the complete system design and implementation plan for the **EV Charging Station Management & Software Metrics Dashboard**. The system unites an end-to-end operational EV charging network platform with an enterprise Software Quality & Operational Performance Dashboard powered by real data from **SonarQube Cloud** and **Jira Cloud**.

---

### 2. Tech Stack Architecture

| Layer | Technologies | Key Responsibilities |
|---|---|---|
| **Frontend** | React 18, Vite, TypeScript, Recharts, Lucide Icons, Vanilla CSS Design System | Responsive dual-role UI (Customer & Admin), EV Booking & Session Management, 10-Metric Quality Dashboard, Trends, Dark/Light Mode |
| **Backend** | Python 3.11+, FastAPI, Pydantic v2, SQLAlchemy 2.0, Uvicorn | High-performance async REST API, JWT OAuth2 authentication, EV business logic, Real SonarQube & Jira REST clients |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL 15+ (with SQLite dynamic auto-fallback for isolated testing/local execution) | Relational schema for EV operations, historical metric snapshots, encrypted/persisted API credentials |
| **Integrations** | SonarQube Cloud REST API v2, Atlassian Jira Cloud REST API v3 | Live retrieval of 8 code quality metrics and 2 custom operational metrics; zero synthetic/fake figures |
| **Deployment** | Docker, Docker Compose, Nginx | Multi-container composition (db, backend, frontend) with unified network and environment injection |
| **CI / Quality** | GitHub Actions, SonarCloud Scanner, Pytest, Vitest | Continuous code inspection, automated unit & integration testing, LCOV test coverage generation |

